{"body":"Merge HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 request cookies on Kestrel\r\n\r\n## Description\r\nAdded a check to squash request cookies into a single cookie string delimited by `; ` as per the HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 specs. I also added unit tests to make sure we don't regress this in the future.\r\n\r\nFixes: #26461 ","files":[{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/Core/src/Internal/Http/HttpHeaders.Generated.cs","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/Core/src/Internal/Http/HttpRequestHeaders.cs","additions":9,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/Core/src/Internal/Http2/Http2Stream.cs","additions":4,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/Core/src/Internal/Http3/Http3Stream.cs","additions":4,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/perf/Microbenchmarks/Http2/Http2ConnectionBenchmarkBase.cs","additions":36,"deletions":28,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/perf/Microbenchmarks/Http2/Http2ConnectionEmptyBenchmark.cs","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/shared/KnownHeaders.cs","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/test/InMemory.FunctionalTests/Http2/Http2ConnectionTests.cs","additions":27,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Servers/Kestrel/test/InMemory.FunctionalTests/Http3/Http3ConnectionTests.cs","additions":42,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"title":"Merge HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 request cookies on Kestrel"}
